\v 16 I'll¦124567 say¦124567 it again¦124566: no¦124568 one¦124569 should¦124571 suppose¦124571 that I'm foolish¦124572, but¦124575 if they do, at least accept¦124582 me as¦124580 foolish¦124581 so that¦124584 I can also¦124585 boast¦124589 a little¦124586.
