\v 25 was¦124705 beaten¦124705 three¦124704 times¦124704 with¦124705 rods¦124705, was¦124707 stoned¦124707 once¦124706, shipwrecked¦124709 three¦124708 times¦124708, and¦124710 I was in the ocean for a day¦124710 and a¦124710 night¦124710.\x + \xo 11:25: a \xt Acts 16:22; \xo b \xt Acts 14:19.\x*
\v 26 I've done \add many long\add* trips, crossed dangerous¦124717 rivers¦124718, risked being robbed¦124720, \add was persecuted\add* by my own people as well as by non-Jews, have been in danger in the¦124729 city¦124729, in the¦124732 wilderness¦124732 and on¦124734 the¦124735 ocean¦124735, \add as well as being attacked\add* by false¦124738 \add teachers\add*.\x + \xo 11:26: a \xt Acts 9:23; \xo b \xt Acts 14:5.\x*
