\v 1 It's¦124842 not appropriate¦124842 or beneficial¦124846 to¦124840 be¦124840 boasting¦124840, so I'll¦124849 come¦124849 to¦124853 \add the\add* visions¦124854 and¦124855 revelations¦124856 from \nd Yahweh¦124857\nd*.\f + \fr 12:1 \ft See http://bibledifferences.net/2019/04/24/156-boast.\f*
\v 2 Fourteen¦124864 years¦124863 ago I¦124858 observed a¦124859 man¦124859 who was a believer in¦124860 \nd Messiah¦124861\nd* who was¦124879 pulled \add up\add* to¦124882 the¦124884 third¦124884 heaven¦124885. (I didn't know whether¦124865 this physically happened or¦124870 just in the spiritual \add realm\add*.)
